# Neither additional cost can be paid: Bot1 has put its whole hand onto the battlefield on turn 1 (the Moxen and Black Lotus
# are free) and then draws Bone Shards, so on turn 3 there is no other card to discard and no creature to sacrifice, and
# Bone Shards cannot be cast though Bot2 has a creature and Bot1 a Swamp to pay {B} (CR 601.2b, 118.3). On turn 5 an Ornithopter
# is drawn and cast: now the sacrifice is payable, the cost is taken without asking, and the spell is cast - the positive control.

